<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>NoteCard — 预览</title>
<style>
  html, body { margin:0; height:100%; }
  body { background:var(--surface-navigation); color:var(--ink); font-family:var(--font-sans); -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; }
  .list { box-sizing:border-box; width:340px; height:100%; padding:12px 8px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:4px; }
  .card { box-sizing:border-box; display:flex; gap:6px; padding:10px 8px; border-radius:8px; }
  .card.selected { background:var(--surface-row-selected); }
  .card.hover { background:var(--surface-row-hover); }
  .icon-slot { width:18px; height:18px; flex:none; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:var(--ink-muted); margin-top:1px; }
  .icon-slot svg { width:14px; height:14px; }
  .body { min-width:0; flex:1; }
  .title { font-size:15px; line-height:20px; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink); overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap; }
  .card.selected .title { color:var(--ink-row-selected); }
  .excerpt { margin-top:2px; font-size:13px; line-height:18px; color:var(--ink-muted); display:-webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp:2; -webkit-box-orient:vertical; overflow:hidden; }
  .meta { margin-top:6px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; font-size:12px; line-height:16px; color:var(--ink-muted); }
  .dot { width:2px; height:2px; border-radius:50%; background:currentColor; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="list">
  <article class="card selected">
    <span class="icon-slot"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"/><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"/><path d="M16 13H8"/><path d="M16 17H8"/><path d="M10 9H8"/></svg></span>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="title">周五的产品评审</div>
      <div class="excerpt">把首页的信息层级再收一层：标题、摘要、元数据，只保留一个主行动。</div>
      <div class="meta"><span>产品</span><span class="dot"></span><span>3 天前</span></div>
    </div>
  </article>
  <article class="card">
    <span class="icon-slot"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"/><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"/><path d="M16 13H8"/><path d="M16 17H8"/><path d="M10 9H8"/></svg></span>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="title">十一月读书笔记</div>
      <div class="excerpt">《阴翳礼赞》里关于纸与光的段落，适合放在夜间主题的说明里。</div>
      <div class="meta"><span>阅读</span><span class="dot"></span><span>昨天</span></div>
    </div>
  </article>
  <article class="card hover">
    <span class="icon-slot"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8Z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/><path d="M16 13H8"/><path d="M16 17H8"/></svg></span>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="title">会议记录 · 十一月</div>
      <div class="excerpt">每周三 10:00，产品与设计同步；结论写在最上面。</div>
      <div class="meta"><span>会议</span><span class="dot"></span><span>10 月 28 日</span></div>
    </div>
  </article>
</div>
</body>
</html>
